.TH "convbin" "1" "" "" "Pocket SDR"
.SH NAME
convbin \- Convert receiver logs / RTCM streams to RINEX
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
convbin [option ...] file
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert receiver\-binary log files, RTCM streams, and RINEX files to RINEX OBS / NAV / SBAS files.
Pocket SDR\(cqs \f[CR]convbin\f[R] is the RTKLIB \f[CR]convbin\f[R] with extensions for RTCM3 array\-mode conversion, MSM signal\-ID extensions, and a default RINEX version of 3.05.
.PP
The full option list is long; only the most\-used options are summarized below.
For the complete option list and per\-format message lists, run \f[CR]convbin \-h\f[R].
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
\f[CR]\-r format\f[R]
Input format.
One of \f[CR]rtcm2\f[R], \f[CR]rtcm3\f[R], \f[CR]nov\f[R], \f[CR]oem3\f[R], \f[CR]ubx\f[R], \f[CR]ss2\f[R], \f[CR]hemis\f[R], \f[CR]stq\f[R], \f[CR]javad\f[R], \f[CR]nvs\f[R], \f[CR]binex\f[R],
\f[CR]rt17\f[R], \f[CR]sbf\f[R], \f[CR]rinex\f[R].
Auto\-detected from the file extension if omitted.
.TP
\f[CR]\-v ver\f[R]
Output RINEX version (e.g.\ \f[CR]3.05\f[R], \f[CR]3.04\f[R], \f[CR]2.11\f[R]).
[\f[CR]3.05\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-ts y/m/d h:m:s\f[R], \f[CR]\-te y/m/d h:m:s\f[R], \f[CR]\-ti tint\f[R]
Start time, end time, observation interval (s).
.TP
\f[CR]\-f n\f[R]
Number of signal frequencies to output (1..5 → L1..L5).
[\f[CR]5\f[R]]
.TP
\f[CR]\-y sys[,...]\f[R]
Excluded systems, comma\-separated (\f[CR]G\f[R]/\f[CR]R\f[R]/\f[CR]E\f[R]/\f[CR]J\f[R]/\f[CR]S\f[R]/\f[CR]C\f[R]/\f[CR]I\f[R]).
.TP
\f[CR]\-mask sig[,...]\f[R]
Signal/code masks.
Each \f[CR]sig\f[R] is \f[CR]<sys>L<code>\f[R] (e.g.\ \f[CR]GL1C\f[R], \f[CR]EL1B\f[R], \f[CR]JL2X\f[R]).
\f[CR]\-nomask\f[R] clears specific masks.
.TP
\f[CR]\-o file\f[R], \f[CR]\-n file\f[R], \f[CR]\-g file\f[R], \f[CR]\-h file\f[R], \f[CR]\-q file\f[R], \f[CR]\-l file\f[R], \f[CR]\-b file\f[R], \f[CR]\-i file\f[R], \f[CR]\-s file\f[R]
Output file paths for OBS, GPS NAV, GLO NAV, SBAS NAV, QZS NAV, GAL NAV, BDS NAV, NavIC NAV, and SBAS message files.
.TP
\f[CR]\-d dir\f[R]
Output directory.
.TP
\f[CR]\-trace level\f[R]
Enable RTKLIB trace at the given level.
.TP
\f[CR]\-array\f[R]
(Pocket SDR extension) RTCM3 array mode.
Splits MSM by station ID into per\-CH RINEX OBS files.
Requires \f[CR]\-r rtcm3\f[R].
.TP
\f[CR]\-xd\f[R], \f[CR]\-xs\f[R]
(Pocket SDR extensions) Disable Doppler / SNR fields in the output OBS.
.TP
\f[CR]\-h\f[R]
Print full help (extensive) and exit.
.TP
\f[CR]\-ver\f[R]
Print version and exit.
.TP
\f[CR]file\f[R]
Input file path.
Wildcards are \f[I]not\f[R] expanded on Windows.
